   122	- Stage-C build 3 imported `coalition_identity`, absent from the stage-4d target snapshot. A compatibility implementation restored both exact B4 identities and accepts uncapped selected coalitions.
   123	- The fixed provider imported `ProviderAttestation`, absent from the stage-4d tape snapshot, and lacked the older `protocol_outputs` method. A data-only attestation seam and adapter were added; physical calculations are unchanged.
