+## 6. The 664 per cent perfect-knowledge figure and its baseline
+
+[READ] The fixed carrier's `nearest-eligible` assignment enumerates legal actions in increasing slant-range order and chooses the first. It does not optimize load, interference, coupled power, energy, history, or the pooled objective. (`src/mcrl/physics_v025/tapes.py:962-974`, `src/mcrl/physics_v025/tapes.py:977-1017`) [READ] By contrast, S_UNI receives every legal action and repeatedly evaluates the exact joint objective, including the preference term, until its budget/termination condition. (`.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/probe/run_v025_matrix_probe.py:1831-1873`)
+
+[EXEC] Across the 6,000 nearest-baseline user-anchor cases in the two-world training corpus, the baseline reference action was the best action even within the already truncated source shortlist by nominal link margin only 49 times (`0.817%`). In 5,951 cases a shortlisted alternative had a better nominal margin; the reference had a mean of `7.255` better alternatives (mean rank `8.255`, maximum rank `9`). Mean background occupancy of the chosen reference was `2.217`, maximum `7`. (Rows authenticated by `artifacts/v025-pilot-c3-20260909-PILOT_NOT_CLAIM/PILOT_NOT_CLAIM-rows-manifest.json:1`; reference/shortlist construction at `.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/probe/run_v025_matrix_probe.py:473-523` and `src/mcrl/physics_v025/tapes.py:962-1017`.)
+
+[INFERENCE] The baseline is fair only for the narrow, transparently named question “how much better than the fixed external nearest-eligible carrier assignment?” It is not a matched comparator for a perfect-knowledge optimizer. As the sole efficacy comparator it is effectively a straw man: a roughly 664% improvement would mostly measure the gap from a geometry-only, usually bottom-ranked reference to an exact joint optimizer, not the value of learning or coordination.
+
+[READ] The contract itself supplies the appropriate matched comparator: S_UNI with identical nominal physics and a completed-neighbourhood certificate; a budget-limited S_UNI must be labelled operational and cannot support a beyond-unilateral claim. (`V025-STAGES-6-8-CONTRACT-v1-2026-09-08.md:20-22`; `V025-STAGES-6-8-CONTRACT-v1.2-AMENDMENT-2026-09-09.md:10`) [READ] The minimal pilot's S_UNI was degenerate/skipped under its runtime conditions, so it did not provide that matched comparison. (`V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:109-114`)
+
+[READ] No artifact in this snapshot contains the literal 664% result. [INFERENCE] I therefore cannot authenticate that percentage itself from this workspace, and I do not reproduce it as a verified measurement. The baseline assignment and its weakness, however, are independently verified above.
